; xrRazom — glowstick tracking table, for xrr_patch_glowstick.script.
; zz_glowstick_mcm keeps its live glowstick set (id -> {section, charge}) in a
; file-local the module.fn patch idiom cannot reach; the engine's Lua
; unlocalizer promotes it to a zz_glowstick_mcm field. Interaction Dot Marks
; declares the same variable, and sections merge additively across unlocalizer
; files — this is our own copy so the patch does not depend on that mod.

[zz_glowstick_mcm]
glowsticks
